============================================================================== 
THE RATIO THAT MATTERS IS NOT THE TOKEN RATIO 
============================================================================== 
NO tier, 795,408 identities 
  tokens only : Haiku $10,420 vs Opus $53,213  -> Opus costs 5.1x 
  full bill   : Haiku $45,418 vs Opus $78,666  -> Opus costs 1.73x 
  search is 77% of Haiku's bill and 32% of Opus's 
 
So on this tier the model choice is worth $33,248 and the search budget is 
worth $34,998. Capping max_uses is the lever; picking the cheap model is not. 
 
With the Batch API's 50% discount applied to TOKENS ONLY (search billing 
at list -- the batch discount on per-use server tools is not established 
in this repo and is not assumed here): 
