 escalate low -> deep- (no search)  $6,016         0  $6,016 96.3% (26/27)
    escalate low -> deep+ (search) $12,649   389,160 $16,541 96.3% (26/27)
                  deep+ everywhere $66,595 2,162,002 $88,215 92.6% (25/27)
 
Escalating to the NO-SEARCH deep arm reaches the same 26/27 as the search 
arm for $6,016 instead of $16,541. The +3.7 points search adds on the 27 is one 
case (McNemar exact p = 1.000) -- not distinguishable from zero, and not 
ruled out either. What search measurably buys is CONFIDENCE (high 51% -> 
73%), which is not the thing being paid for. 
