LAYER 0 -- deterministic character recovery, no API at all 
============================================================================== 
pf_fuzzy_recover() at the 0.90 default: 521 s, 8.9% of the 5830 s match 
  +24 identities to YES on 2,009 residual; 0 YES identities broken 
  reaches 3 of the 33 web-established EINs, agrees on 2, contradicts 1 
  marginal cost per corpus run: $0 
 
Projected to 4,582,301 identities the scan is ~136 core-hours, which is 
compute, not billing. Against $662 for the cheapest LLM layer on MAYBE 
alone, it is the only layer whose cost does not scale with the corpus. 
